# Vite client env (see https://vitejs.dev/guide/env-and-mode.html)
# Main API (app data, auth, etc. — no /api/v1 required in this URL):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app-api.example.com

# Stripe & PayPal: (VITE_PAYMENTS_API_URL || VITE_API_BASE_URL) + /api/v1
# If that URL is localhost, the app still calls the deployed payments host (see src/services/payments/apiRoot.ts).
# Set explicitly when your payments API differs from the main API (omit trailing /api/v1):
# VITE_PAYMENTS_API_URL=https://trivia-back-end.vercel.app
